[mapsetid:2578730]
[ar:Toby Fox feat. かめりあ]
[ti:Flower Man]
[tr:好人汉化组]
[00:24.388]Ten feet twenty the Flower Man
[00:24.388]（三米五六的小花侠）
[00:27.888]Is waiting for the touch of his hand
[00:27.888]（期盼那双手呵护有加）
[00:31.182]Straightening petals out without a plan
[00:31.182]（整理着花瓣却有向无方）
[00:34.175]Like the every daily
[00:34.175]（只顾那个每天）
[00:36.487]Wish that bothered the Flower Man
[00:36.487]（萦绕在心头的愿望）
[00:39.844]Could I do something to make him laugh
[00:39.844]（如何能让他笑得欢畅）
[00:43.212]Inside my little chamber made of glass
[00:43.212]（生活在我的小小玻璃缸）
[00:46.199]So he lived the
[00:46.199]（苦恼着的）
[00:47.655]Flower man, flower man
[00:47.655]（小花侠　小花侠）
[00:50.765]With his heart in the sand
[00:50.765]（寸草心　沙中藏）
[00:53.607]So he stands
[00:53.607]（把头仰）
[00:55.577]To watch the whole wide world
[00:55.577]（望见纷繁世界）
[00:58.350]From a can
[00:58.350]（隔道墙）
[00:59.733]Way up high in the sky
[00:59.733]（看天空　在发亮）
[01:02.715]With the sun in his eyes
[01:02.715]（太阳光　透进房）
[01:05.687]Ain't it nice
[01:05.687]（多明朗）
[01:07.622]The life forever for flowers
[01:07.622]（花一成不变的　日常）
[02:24.437]Ten feet twenty the Flower Man
[02:24.437]（三米五六的小花侠）
[02:27.884]Is waiting the touch of his hand
[02:27.884]（期盼那双手呵护有加）
[02:31.167]Fallen to pieces without a plan
[02:31.167]（四分五裂依旧有向无方）
[02:34.154]Yet the every daily
[02:34.154]（可那岁岁年年）
[02:36.387]Hope that powered the Flower Man
[02:36.387]（给予着力量的希望）
[02:39.885]Would never cower off of its path
[02:39.885]（定好方向就绝不退让）
[02:43.237]Even if broken I am more than glass
[02:43.237]（哪怕再受伤也比玻璃强）
[02:46.196]So he lived the
[02:46.196]（多执着的）
[02:47.703]Flower Man, Flower Man
[02:47.703]（小花侠　小花侠）
[02:50.838]With his heart in the sand
[02:50.838]（寸草心　沙中藏）
[02:53.650]So he stands
[02:53.650]（把头仰）
[02:55.556]To watch the whole wide world
[02:55.556]（望见纷繁世界）
[02:58.362]From a can
[02:58.362]（隔道墙）
[02:59.689]Way up high in the sky
[02:59.689]（看天空　在发亮）
[03:02.741]With the sun in your eyes
[03:02.741]（太阳光　透进房）
[03:05.696]Ain't it nice
